WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:03.380
- [Mark] Alright, Tyrone.

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.213
Tyrone, where did you grow up?

00:00:04.213 --> 00:00:05.190
Where are you from originally?

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.830
- I'm from Chicago, Illinois.

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.450
- [Mark] Chicago. And
tell me about your family.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:10.280
You had both your parents
when you were a kid?

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:13.150
- Well, I was with my parents,

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.050
but Pops was never around.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.300
He was an alcoholic, workaholic.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.273
Moms was just kind of quiet,

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:22.983
you know what I'm saying?

00:00:22.983 --> 00:00:25.770
Quiet and just seemed like she was lost,

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:26.670
'cause I was lost.

00:00:28.233 --> 00:00:31.357
They used to always take me
over to Grandma and Grandpa's.

00:00:32.268 --> 00:00:34.110
I used to go over to Grandma's
house when I was a kid,

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.730
five or six years old, and I'd stay

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:37.563
with Grandma all the time.

00:00:37.563 --> 00:00:40.010
There wasn't no TV in her house.

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:40.843
You know what I'm saying?

00:00:40.843 --> 00:00:43.330
And this man used to
always come over there.

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:47.470
See my mother is my father's second wife.

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:50.053
See, when my father,

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:53.810
when I got older and I was
looking at the birth certificate,

00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:57.710
Daddy was like 45, Mama was 21.

00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:59.170
So Daddy had kids before

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:03.550
from his first wife,

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:06.410
so that's gonna end up in my story

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:09.730
because I'm gonna tell you,
the Boogeyman really exists.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.170
Now this man when I was
over at Grandma's house,

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:14.670
this guy always used to
come in and beat Grandma up.

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.570
Grandma always used to have black eyes.

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:18.490
Then I used to try and save Grandma

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:20.860
and he used to beat me up and throw me

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:22.040
in the next room,

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.093
and he did whatever he did with Grandma

00:01:24.093 --> 00:01:26.840
'cause I could just hear her screaming,

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:28.630
but then he was coming over there with me

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:29.973
and do things to me.

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:33.440
This went on for awhile,

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:34.720
when I was five, six, seven,

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.660
eight, nine, 10 years old

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:40.320
and nobody never said nothing.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:43.910
I wanted to know, did Daddy know?

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:45.050
Mama wasn't gonna say nothing.

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:47.390
Mama was quiet anyway.

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:48.823
But I wondered, you know,

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.480
did Daddy ever know about me

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:54.700
because Daddy, he used
to always come get me

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:55.533
from Grandma's.

00:01:55.533 --> 00:01:57.003
I used to go over there every day,

00:01:59.031 --> 00:02:00.970
but he would take me back everyday

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:04.260
because Daddy had work and Mama did

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:07.453
whatever she did at
home, if she stayed home.

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:13.460
And those things, he was kept
doing these things to me,

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:15.660
and I kinda seemed like
it was kinda normal.

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:18.683
I was kinda liking it

00:02:19.597 --> 00:02:21.810
and looking forward to things like that.

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:22.643
- [Mark] Sexual things?

00:02:22.643 --> 00:02:23.563
- Sexual things.

00:02:24.805 --> 00:02:27.400
But see, I was a kid, I didn't know.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:28.641
- [Mark] Started at five years old?

00:02:28.641 --> 00:02:30.775
- Started at five years old,

00:02:30.775 --> 00:02:34.710
and it's like following me, planning,

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:38.180
doing things, and it's time like that

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:42.083
I wanted that type of
attention from a man.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.787
And I'm not saying I'm a...

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:47.390
I just wanted that
attention from, you know.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:48.850
When I was a kid, it just seemed like

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:50.890
it was the thing to do

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:54.863
to have a strong hand
around me, or touching me.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:57.487
And I didn't know.

00:02:57.487 --> 00:02:59.660
And I would always wonder,

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:03.113
and as time went by,
this man kept showing up.

00:03:04.535 --> 00:03:06.477
You know what I'm saying?

00:03:06.477 --> 00:03:08.760
And he was coming over to the house

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:12.133
and I was like, you know what I'm saying?

00:03:13.114 --> 00:03:14.680
And he would stay over at the house,

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:16.833
man, what is this man?

00:03:18.295 --> 00:03:20.720
There was all, but nobody said nothing.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.940
I never said nothing,

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:25.010
because I was too scared to say something

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:26.773
but I enjoyed him being around.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.350
He would eat, he would stay over,

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:34.940
but he would come in my room

00:03:36.990 --> 00:03:37.823
late at night.

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:45.750
Sometimes I come in the room,

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:49.180
he'd be sitting playing with my games

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:50.483
and tell me to come over.

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:54.287
In my room and I'd sit right next to him.

00:03:55.304 --> 00:03:58.370
It seemed like nobody didn't know nothing,

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.300
or nobody didn't care.

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.623
I don't know, I was a kid.

00:04:04.330 --> 00:04:06.860
But I believed, at that time,

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:08.303
everything was all right.

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.257
It was the thing to do, you know?

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.800
And you know how they say, the Boogeyman?

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.830
He was under your bed and in your closet

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:21.663
when you was a kid,

00:04:21.663 --> 00:04:24.353
that's all we had was the
Boogeyman to be scared of.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.580
You know what I'm saying? So
when I would come in the room,

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.620
as time, I kept coming in the room,

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:33.470
so as time, the lights was always off

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:36.303
but there was only a little
corner with a light in it

00:04:36.303 --> 00:04:37.523
with my game.

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:43.170
And when I come in, I'd
just go straight over there.

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:48.867
Daddy, if he wasn't at work,
he was drunk somewhere.

00:04:48.867 --> 00:04:50.393
Daddy was a workaholic.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.033
Workaholic, alcoholic.

00:04:54.456 --> 00:04:56.406
And Mama didn't say nothing anyway, so.

00:04:57.299 --> 00:05:00.173
You know, back in the day,
a woman stayed in her place.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:04.460
And you ain't got, don't say nothing.

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:06.543
A man paid the cost to be the boss.

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:09.210
That's how it was when I grew up.

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:15.193
Kids is not to say a
word, seen but not spoken,

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:17.653
and that's how it was.

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:22.303
As time went by, it's
just whatever happened,

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:24.520
it was supposed to be normal.

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:26.510
But was I normal or was I abnormal?

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:29.680
Was I the same, was I sane?

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:30.970
I don't know.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:35.970
I was so confused, and this
man just kept on being around

00:05:37.744 --> 00:05:39.523
and he was about as old as Mama.

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:43.710
I'm gonna tell ya,
that's gonna keep going.

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:44.860
He was old as Mama,

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.270
and nobody said nothing to him

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:48.780
'cause he was always around.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:49.790
I'm like...

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:57.630
But everyday, when Daddy did go to work,

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:00.110
they would take me to Grandma's house

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:02.460
and he'd end up coming
over to Grandma's house.

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:06.953
Grandma even knew him
and would let him in.

00:06:08.395 --> 00:06:11.659
Man, what's wrong?

00:06:11.659 --> 00:06:13.307
What's happening, man?

00:06:13.307 --> 00:06:16.040
I'm just confused about this man

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:18.990
because everybody seemed
like it's all right with him

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.100
so I'm trying to be all right with him,

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:25.513
but the things he's doing to me,

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:29.340
I guess it's all right

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:32.250
because ain't nobody else said nothing.

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:35.840
Ain't nobody said a word.

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:38.490
So he would sit at the
table, he would eat,

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:42.653
he would do everything like
he was part of the family.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.073
And as time went by, he
was part of the family.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:53.193
He was my half brother from
my father's first wife.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:57.040
And I never knew this.

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.993
He was just as old as my mama.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:04.610
My pops left his first
wife and then meet my mama,

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.870
and as I said, he was about 45 somewhere,

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:09.053
Mama was 21.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:14.830
So when I looked at my birth certificate

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.670
when I was a kid growing up,

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:20.530
I said, Daddy, I saw a big difference was.

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:22.810
And as time went by and when I got older

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:27.613
and I found out that was his first son.

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:31.480
He's a junior, 'cause I wanted to realize

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:32.773
why I wasn't a junior.

00:07:33.708 --> 00:07:35.223
I wanted to be like my daddy.

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:38.970
I wanted to be a workaholic.

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:40.550
My pops, rest in peace,

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:44.423
stayed on his job for 47 years, same job.

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:47.513
I could never do that.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.090
I could never do that.

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:53.673
I wanted to be just like him,

00:07:55.716 --> 00:07:57.012
but my papa used to always say,

00:07:57.012 --> 00:07:59.429
"Well, you ain't your daddy."

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.853
My daddy was strong

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.623
and I had nobody to look up to,

00:08:08.874 --> 00:08:12.322
