gave me some attention

00:08:12.322 --> 00:08:14.423
and I grew up all,

00:08:14.423 --> 00:08:16.030
but Mama wasn't strong.

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:18.613
My mama did the best she could.

00:08:24.797 --> 00:08:27.528
She did the best she could.

00:08:27.528 --> 00:08:30.445
And you know, the way I was raised,

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:36.560
