00:09:17.017 --> 00:09:22.017
Family. (sighs)

00:09:22.323 --> 00:09:24.630
Family's very important to have, man.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:29.630
And friends that you grew up
with from the get on is family.

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:32.573
You call his mama, Mama.

00:09:34.712 --> 00:09:35.730
That's how we were,

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:40.160
but I had other things happen in my life

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:43.063
