00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:48.070
And as time went by, man,

00:09:48.070 --> 00:09:49.523
I had to learn how to adapt.

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:55.590
I had to learn how to survive, you know?

00:09:55.590 --> 00:10:00.590
But right now, I'm just
existing, I'm not living.

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:02.743
I got a lot of shit inside me, man.

00:10:04.058 --> 00:10:07.640
And there's a difference
between existing and living,

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:10.552
'cause when you're
existing you're just here

00:10:10.552 --> 00:10:14.380
