00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:09.963
They wanna feel better than you,

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:13.080
so if I tell you something about me

00:15:13.997 --> 00:15:17.453
to help you feel better
about yourself to down on me.

00:15:19.378 --> 00:15:22.290
You know, when I'm out there, man,

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.330
I don't have.

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:27.083
Whatever you do, it ain't
got nothing to do with me.

00:15:27.980 --> 00:15:29.380
It ain't gonna help me,

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.813
it ain't gonna hurt me,

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:34.470
it definitely ain't gonna
get me off these streets.

00:15:36.683 --> 00:15:39.140
And it ain't gonna help the
situation that I'm going through

00:15:39.140 --> 00:15:41.420
'cause I go through things too.

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:45.190
So why should I take on
what you're going through

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:46.260
'cause I can't carry it.

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:48.440
I can't carry what I got,

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:50.830
so how in the hell am I
gonna carry what you got?

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:52.770
So I don't care what you do out there

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:56.790
'cause it ain't got nothing to do with me.

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:59.910
Nothing, you know?

00:16:01.522 --> 00:16:03.750
Honestly man, mother,
father, sister, brother,

00:16:03.750 --> 00:16:06.670
auntie, uncle, if you got a niece, nephew,

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:09.840
kid, someone, whatever, daughter.

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:11.860
If they see something in their room,

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.970
they tell about the Boogeyman,

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:16.453
please go check. (sobs)

00:16:22.716 --> 00:16:27.716
There just might be someone in that room

00:16:28.038 --> 00:16:30.038
they're not lying about.

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:32.770
They might not be what they say,

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:34.960
but it's something in that room

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:37.823
that you need to check.

00:16:40.510 --> 00:16:43.800
Sorry, hey, I appreciate y'all.

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:46.913
I don't mean no disrespect up to y'all.

00:16:47.986 --> 00:16:48.944
Thank you.

00:16:48.944 --> 00:16:49.777
- [Mark] All right, Tyrone.

00:16:49.777 --> 00:16:50.610
Thank you very much.

